our request, provide the property information or analysis you asked for, follow up about buying, selling, or investing, improve our website, and meet legal and recordkeeping obligations. We only send marketing messages if you ask us to, and you can opt out at any time.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">How your form is processed</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Form submissions go to our own customer system (CRM), where our agents see them. We also work with an affiliated mortgage lender; if your request involves financing, we may share your information with them so they can help, see our Affiliated Business Arrangement disclosure in the site footer.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .75rem">The listing search</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Our home search shows listings from the Coastal Carolinas MLS. To see full listing details you sign up with your name, email and phone number and accept the listing search terms. We keep those details, the IP address and browser you used, and the version of the terms you accepted.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Once you are signed up, we record which listings you open, how long each one is on your screen, and the homes you save with the heart. Before you sign up, your browser keeps a short list of the listings you opened on this device; we receive that list only if you sign up. Signing up does not sign you up for texts or calls: we text or call only if you tick the separate, optional box that asks for that consent.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">The sign-up form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to tell people from bots. We never send your name, email or phone number to Google Analytics, and never a listing number together with anything that identifies you.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .75rem">The property analyzer and address lookup</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem">When you use the investment analyzer at <a href="/invest/long-term-rental/" style="color:var(--brass)">/invest/long-term-rental/</a> or type in its address box, the property address you enter is sent to third-party services so the tool can look up and analyze that property. We do not send your name, email or phone number to any of them.</p><ul style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 1rem 1.15rem"><li><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Anthropic</strong> (United States) receives the property address and the property details you enter, and returns the written analysis. Anthropic does not use data submitted through its API to train its models.</li><li><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Cloudflare</strong> (United States) runs the service that makes these requests and stores the resulting analysis for up to twelve months, so that the same address returns the same numbers to everyone who looks it up. What is stored is the property analysis, keyed to the address. It is not linked to you.</li><li><strong style="color:var(--navy)">The United States Census Bureau geocoder</strong> converts an address into map coordinates.</li><li><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Photon</strong>, an address-suggestion service operated by Komoot in <strong style="color:var(--navy)">Germany</strong>, receives what you type in the address box in order to suggest matching addresses. This means that text leaves the United States.</li><li><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Horry County, South Carolina</strong> public GIS records are queried for nearby building permits.</li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem">If you would rather not have an address processed this way, do not enter it in the analyzer. To ask what is stored for a particular address, or to have it removed, email <a href="mailto:hello@chapter3realty.com" style="color:var(--brass)">hello@chapter3realty.com</a>.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Who we share it with</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers who help us operate (such as our customer system, analytics and bot-check providers, and our affiliated lender when relevant), or when required by law.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Cookies and analytics</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">We use cookies and similar tools for analytics. You can control cookies in your browser settings, and you can opt out of Google Analytics using Google&rsquo;s browser add-on.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Your choices</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">You can ask us to access, correct, or delete the information you&rsquo;ve given us, and you can unsubscribe from our messages, by emailing hello@chapter3realty.com.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--navy);margin:2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Changes</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">We may update this policy; the &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date above reflects the current version.</p><div style="border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:2.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem"><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:760px">Questions about this policy? Email <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--brass);text-decoration:none">hello@chapter3realty.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+18543332135" style="color:var(--brass);text-decoration:none">854.333.2135</a>.</p></div></div></section>
